From: Wisbendji Fimerlus <archledger236@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] window: Expose requested geometry on KWin 6.8.2

SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Wisbendji Fimerlus <archledger236@gmail.com>
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

Adapt the optional requestedGeometry API and its five regression tests
to KWin 6.8.2. The original proposal was KDE MR !10225 (not merged):
https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/10225

Keep the last-notified rectangle outside Window to preserve its binary
layout. Notify after the operation, with the guarded post-mapping path
shared by xdg-shell roles. KWin 6.8.2 synchronizes toplevel and PiP
geometry only when no configure is queued or scheduled; document that
stricter rule without changing upstream geometry synchronization.

---

